  <justification>
    <existing>No existing per-caller trim on this route — `OfficeService.cs:1699-1735` queries app-only. The closest existing mechanism is `AuthorizeRowsAsync` used by `RecordSearchAuthorizationFilter` and by task 032's visualization trim.</existing>
    <extension>Yes — extend the existing authorization mechanism onto this route rather than inventing a new one. A new contract-test file is new surface only because no authorization test exists for this route today.</extension>
    <cost-of-doing-nothing>Any authenticated user enumerates every Matter, Project, Invoice, Account and Contact in the tenant, including secure matters, and harvests the GUIDs that findings F2, F3 and F4 act on.</cost-of-doing-nothing>
  </justification>

